📊 College Attendance Tracker
web application to track college attendance subject-wise with a clean dashboard, calendar-based marking system, and secure user authentication.

🔹 Project Overview

College Attendance Tracker is a modern web application where students can:
-> Create an account
-> Add their own subjects
-> Mark attendance using a calendar
-> View subject-wise attendance percentage
-> Access their data securely after login
-> Each user has completely isolated data, meaning no user can see another user’s subjects or attendance.

🔹 Key Features
✅ User Authentication

  -> Email & password based login
  -> Secure session handling
  -> Each user has a separate account

✅ Subject Management

   ->Users can add multiple subjects
   ->Subjects are saved permanently
   ->Subject list reloads correctly on login
✅ Attendance Tracking (Core Feature)

Calendar-based attendance marking

✅ Three attendance states:

🟢 Present

🔴 Absent

🔵 Official Leave / Sunday

->Date color changes instantly after selection
->Attendance is saved per subject, per user

How to Use:
1. Register: Create an account and add your subjects during setup.
2. Dashboard: View your subject cards with live attendance percentages.
3. Mark Attendance: Click a subject card to open the calendar and tap dates to toggle status (Present → Absent → Leave → Clear).
4. Track Progress: Watch your attendance percentage update instantly.

